# Workflow Hooks

This repo may use `.cursor/hooks.json` to auto-continue with `doc-sync` after subagents stop.

| After subagent | Next step |
|----------------|-----------|
| `phase-executor` | Invoke `doc-sync` (implementation sync) |
| `test-runner` | Invoke `doc-sync` (verification sync) |
